---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Notice | Gibraltar For Sale" description="Privacy notice for Gibraltar For Sale. We collect minimal data for waitlist registration and analytics.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">Privacy notice</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">How we handle your data</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-stone-600">Last updated 8 November 2026</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-8">
      <p>This site collects minimal personal data: only what you voluntarily provide when joining our waitlist (name, email, preferences) and standard web analytics. We do not sell your data or share it with third parties for marketing.</p>
      <h2 id="what-we-collect">What we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Waitlist submissions:</strong> Name, email, property preferences, timeline and optional message — only when you explicitly submit the form.</p>
      <p><strong>Analytics:</strong> Anonymous page views, referrer, device type and country via privacy-friendly analytics (no cookies, no personal identifiers).</p>
      <p><strong>Technical logs:</strong> The hosting platform (Netlify) processes standard request logs (IP, user agent, timestamp) for security and performance. We do not access or store these.</p>
      <h2 id="how-we-use-it">How we use it</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Waitlist: to notify you when verified listings launch and send relevant market updates.</li>
        <li>Analytics: to understand which guides are most useful and improve the site.</li>
        <li>Security: to detect abuse and protect the service.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="your-rights">Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can unsubscribe from waitlist emails at any time via the link in every email. To request deletion of your waitlist data, email us (see Contact page). Analytics data is anonymous and cannot be linked to you.</p>
      <h2 id="third-party">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We use Netlify for hosting and analytics. Their privacy policies apply to data they process. We do not use Google Analytics, Meta pixels, or advertising trackers.</p>
      <h2 id="contact">Questions</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/contact/" class="font-bold text-sea-700 underline">Contact page</a> for how to reach us about privacy matters.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
